    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just exhaustion though. exhaustion implies you can sleep it off. this is different. it’s like the light has been permanently turned off and i’m just sitting in the dark waiting for something that’s never coming back. it feels more like a realization than a phase. like the truth is finally coming out—that there was never anything special there to begin with, just an empty vessel.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
